#0
ACCOUNT-EXPERIENCE ACCOUNT-XP ACCOUNTS

Luminari uses an account system to collect all of a player's characters in 
one place.  Each player should only have one account.  
 
If you have characters that were created prior to the installation of the 
account system, you can use the 	n(	CA	n)	cdd	n command in the account menu to 
add those characters to your account.  
 
If you mistakenly add a character to an incorrect account, please contact a 
Forger to update it for you.  
 
The 	Yaccount	n command will display information about your account.
 
Type 	Yaccexp	n to view unlockable races/classes.

Currently you gain account experience if you attain a large enough
experience total from a quest, or mobile, etc.

This helpfile will be updated as new features are added to the account 
system.

