	c>Description:	n
	n
Acrobatics is a skill that represents your overall ability to jump,
balance and tumble.
	n
It's current implementation include:
- Putting away objects in battle will require an acrobatics check, or you
     will use a swift action (DC 15)
- Getting objects out of containers will require an acrobatic check, or you
     will use a swift action (DC 15)
- Fleeing requires a successful tumble check against (DC 20)
- A tumble check against (DC 15) is required when you switch opponents or
     opponents will get an attack of opportunity against you
	n
Also every 7 points you have calculated in acrobatics will give you a bonus to
your AC.
	n
	YSee also:	n  SKILLS
