#0
ALCHEMIST-MUTAGENS SWALLOW

Usage: swallow mutagen (strength|constitution|dexterity) alchemical [optional]
     : swallow cognatogen (intelligence|wisdom|charisma) alchemical [optional]
     : swallow elemental-mutagen (air|earth|fire|water) alchemical [optional]
     : swallow inspiring-cognatogen alchemical [optional]


At 1st level, an alchemist discovers how to create a mutagen that he can imbibe
in order to heighten his physical prowess at the cost of his personality.

When an alchemist brews a mutagen, he selects one physical ability score-either
Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution. It’s a standard action to drink a 
mutagen. Upon being imbibed, the mutagen causes the alchemist to grow bulkier
and more bestial, granting him a +2 natural armor bonus and a +4 alchemical
bonus to the selected ability score for 10 minutes per alchemist level. In
addition, while the mutagen is in effect, the alchemist takes a -2 penalty
to one of his mental ability scores. If the mutagen enhances his Strength, it
applies a penalty to his Intelligence. If it enhances his Dexterity, it 
applies a penalty to his Wisdom. If it enhances his Constitution, it applies
a penalty to his Charisma.

As an alchemist rises in level, they are able to learn discoveries that can
boost or alter the effects of their mutagen.

Mutagens can be activated by using the swallow command.

You can specify, at the end of the swallow command, the word 'alchemical', if
desired.  This will change the bonus types from enhancement to alchemical,
at a cost of halving the bonuses offered.
