Usage: autosort\n\nBy turning on this option, either by typing the above command, or setting it inside\nthe prefedit menu, you will automatically sort any items you pick up off the ground,\nor from a container on the ground (including NPC corpses). It will also auto sort\nany random treasure you obtain.\n\nThe items are sorted into the bag associated with the item's type. Type 'bagnames' to\nsee a list of which bag stores which item type(s). You can also type 'bags' to see a list\nwhich also includes how many items are in that bag. If you type 'bags (number)' then it\nwill show you the contents of that bag.\n\nYou can use the sortto and sortfrom commands to manually sort items to and from yours\nbags into or from your main inventory.\n\nSee Also: SORTTO, SORTFROM, BAGS\n\n

