AUTOSTORE

Usage: autostore\n\nBy turning on this setting, you will automatically store any consumable items\nyou obtain, either from picking it up off the ground, getting it from a container\nor corpse on the ground, or from random treasure.\n\nConsumables items include potions, scrolls, wands and staves (not including quarterstaff\nweapons).\n\nYou can manually store and unstore consumables with the store and unstore commands.\n\nYou must have the use stored consumables setting enabled for this to work. It can be\nenabled in the prefedit menu or by typing 'usestored'.\n\nSee Also: STORED CONSUMABLES, STORE, UNSTORE\n\n

#0
BAAZ-DRACONIAN RACE-BAAZ-DRACONIAN

\tG>Description:\tn
\n\tn
\n\tn
\n\tnBaaz Draconians are the smallest of their brethren, made from Brass Dragon "
\n\tneggs, and are commonly used as ground troops. They are usually of chaotic 
\n\tnalignment and as a result are interested in getting what is best for them 
\n\tnindividually. Baaz wear disguises often, concealing their wings and scales 
\n\tnunderneath large hoods and masks when traveling through non-draconian lands. 
\n\tnWhen a Baaz is killed, its body turns to stone and releases a puff of gas 
\n\tnthat paralyzes all nearby enemies.
\n\tn
\n\tG>Racial Abilities:\tn
\n\tn
\n\tWUltravision:\tn                - Can see in the dark.
