#0
BAZAAR

Bazaar

Welcome to the Bazaar!  The bazaar is a simplified version of getting gear
of a specific enhancement level using quest points as the currency.  This is
a great tool for filling missing equipment slots as you search the realms for
the specific treasure you seek!  Note: there is no way to 'identify' items you
purchase from the bazaar.  For equipment slots: head, body, arms, legs, shield
and wielded, you will get a flat enhancement bonus based on your selection.  For
all the other slots you will get a randomized items that is equal level to the
respective enhancement bonus you select.  The name of gear purchased is built via
a randomized system, but you can easily RESTRING the item using a crafting kit.

Syntax: bazaar <item category> <selection number> <enchantment level>
Item Categories: armor, weapon or misc.
If you type: bazaar <item category> with no extra arguments, it will display the 'selection number' choices
Enchantment Level: 0-6

See also: RESTRING

Note: there is no way to 'identify' items **BEFORE** you purchase from the bazaar.
