BERSERKER CLASS-BERSERKER

	m-----------------------------------------------------------------	n
	m>Description:	n
	n
Berserkers are brave, even reckless, and their warrior skills make
them well suited for adventure.  Berserkers have a powerful ability
to rage that makes them stronger and better able to withstand attacks.
They only have the energy to rage for limited amounts of time, but it
is usually enough to get the job done.  Constant exposure to danger
has made Berserkers resistant to damage as well.
	n
