#0
BESHADOWED-BLAST SPELL-BESHADOWED-BLAST

	D>Usage:           	W cast 'beshadowed blast'	n
	D>Accumulative:    	W  	n
	D>Duration:        	W Indefinite 	n
	D>School of Magic: 	W Enchantment 	n
	D>Target(s):       	W Self Only 	n
	D>Magic Resist:    	W  	n
	D>Saving Throw:    	W  	n
	D>Damage Type:     	W  	n
	D>Description:	n
	n
	nThis eldritch essence invocation allows you to change your eldritch blast into a
	nbeshadowed blast. Any living creature struck by a beshadowed blast must succeed
	non a Fortitude save or be blinded for 1 round, giving it a 50% chance to miss in
	ncombat, removing any Dexterity bonuses to AC, adding an additional -2 penalty to
	nAC, and causing it to move at half speed. Additionally, this causes the target
	nto be considered flat-footed (hence the removal of dex bonuses to AC), meaning
	nthat they can be sneak attacked by rogues without the need for flanking.
	n
	n
	n
	YSee also:	n SPELLS
	n
