BLANK DISCARD FORGET UNCOMMUNE

usage:  blank <prayer>
usage:  forget <spell>
usage:  uncommune <spell>
usage:  discard extract

Using these commands will make you purge from first your prayer/memorizing list
then if the spell you request isn't in those lists, it will purge from your
prayed/memorized list.

You can clear everything from your memory using the "all" argument.
example:  blank all / forget all / uncommune all / discard all

See also:  MEMORIZATION PRAYER CONCOCT
