#0
BORROW

Usage: borrow (mob name)\n\n   This ability allows the kender to 'borrow' a random item from the specified\nmob.  The mob must be in the same room as the kender, and the kender must be\nable to see them.  A mob can only be 'borrowed' from once, successful or failed,\neven if a different kender attempted to borrow from them.  The items gained are\nusually junk and can be sold in bulk using the sell command, such as 'sell 99\nvendortrash'.  Occasionally a kender may find something of use, be it coins, or\na magic item of some sort.\n

