#0
BOZAK-DRACONIAN RACE-BOZAK-DRACONIAN

\tG>Description:\tn
\n\tn
\n\tnPossessed of magical talent and strong wills, bozaks are natural leaders -
\n\tnoften willing to give their lives for a cause they deem worthy, but intelligent
\n\tnenough to fight to survive and win. Many bozaks have strong religious
\n\tntendencies, even though they are inherently talented in arcane magic. Bozaks
\n\tnhave sharp, tactically sound minds, and honing skills that bestow high
\n\tnsurvivability. Most bozaks instinctively take charge of a situation and are
\n\tnsuited to military command, and in this they often excel. Bozaks associate all
\n\tnmagic with the gods and quite often have a reverence attached to both their
\n\tninnate and learned magical talents, though if they feel betrayed by divine
\n\tnforces they may hold a grudge that will last a lifetime. Bozaks are tall, with
\n\tnbronze-hued scales-as tiny as fish scales on the draconian's face, growing to
\n\tnthe size of a bronze piece elsewhere on its body. Bozaks sport a pair of
\n\tncurved, ram-like horns on top of their heads. They have small, dragon-like
\n\tnwings they can use to glide.
\n\tn
\n\tG>Racial Abilities:\tn
\n\tn
\n\tWUltravision:\tn                 - Can see in the dark.
\n\tWDraconian Bite:\tn              - Can make a bite attack as a swift action
\n\tWDraconian Bozak Scales:\tn      - Gets a +2 Natural Armor Class bonus
\n\tWDraconian Disease Immunity:\tn  - Immune to disease
\n\tWDraconian Gallop:\tn            - Gains extra movement points when levelling
\n\tWDraconian Devotion:\tn          - Gains combat bonuses when grouped with dragons or other draconians
\n\tWDraconian Controlled Fall:\tn   - Fall damage is reduced
\n\tWBozak Death Throes:\tn          - When a bozak is killed, bones explode dealing AoE piercing damage
\n\tWDraconian Spell Resistance :\tn - Gains 10 + level spell resistance
\n\tWBozak Spellcasting :\tn         - Can cast the following spells at-will: enlarge, reduce, web, invisibility, stinking cloud
\n\tWBozak Lightning Discharge :\tn  - Deals extra lightning damage on melee attacks
\n\tn
\n\tG>Ability Adjustments:  \tW +2 Str, +2 Int, +2 Cha \tn
\n\tn
\n\tG>Experience Modifier:  \tW 1.5x \tn
\n\tn
\n\tYSee also:\tn RACES
\n\tn

