CEXCHANGE

.
CExchange - Currency Exchange
.
Usage: cexchange <currency source> <amount to purchase>
       cexchange [no argument] - to see exchange rates
.
This command is used to exchange in-game currencies including your experience points, gold coins,
account experience or quest points.
.
The exchange order is: exp -> accexp -> gold -> qp -> (back to start) exp -> ...
       currencies: exp | accexp | gold | qp 
.
See: EXCHANGE for hunt-related exchange command.
.
