CHANT OMIT

	n
usage:  chant <no argument> or <spell name>
usage:  omit <spell name>
	n
Typing chant without any argument will list your current list of
spells you have ready and are preparing.
	n
To continue your chant and recover spells, simply type 'rest' and
then 'chant' with no argument, to begin the process.
	n
Type 'chant' <spellname> to add a spell to your chant list.
	n
Type 'omit' <spellname> to remove a spell from your preparing list or
if you want to remove it from your prepared spell list.
	n
See also:  SPELLS PALADIN
