#0
CLASS-INQUISITOR


Inquisitors tend to move from place to place, chasing down enemies 
and researching emerging threats. As a result, they often travel 
with others, if for no other reason than to mask their presence. 
Inquisitors work with members of their faith whenever possible, but 
even such allies are not above suspicion. They can cast a combination
of divine spells and some arcane ones. They can choose one domain, and
are able to perform judgments, which enhance their combat abilities 
against their foe for the duration of the battle.

>Class Abilities:

Judgement
Teamwork
Track
Bane
Divine/Arcane Casting (Compel)

