#0
CLASS-WEAPON-MASTER CLASS-WEAPONMASTER WEAPON-MASTER WEAPONMASTER

Class WeaponMaster

For a weapon master, perfection is found in the mastery of
certain weapons.  A weapon master seeks to unite this weapon
of choice with the body, to make them one and to use the
weapon as naturally and without thought as any other limb.

Hit Dice: 5-10 Hit Points
Proficiencies: None gained
Skill Points: 2 + int-modifier

To qualify as a weapon master, the class has to be unlocked
(accexp class), and the following criteria must be met:
Base Attack Bonus of at least +5
Feats: Weapon Focus, Dodge, Mobility, Combat Expertise,
  Spring Attack, and Whirlwind
Minimum skill rank of 4 in Intimidate

Type 'class feats weaponmaster' to view the full feat list.

Tip: Becoming a WeaponMaster
Make certain your character has at least 13 in dexterity,
strength, and intelligence to qualify for all the feats
needed to become a WeaponMaster.

