	m>Description:	n
	n
Clerics act as intermediaries between the earthly and the gods.  A
good cleric helps those in need, while an evil clerics seeks to spread
his patron's vision of evil across the world.  All clerics can heal
wounds and bring people back from the brink of death.  Likewise all
clerics have authority over the undead and they can turn away or even
destroy them outright.  Due to the nature of divine power and military
training that clerics receive, they are able to wear heavy armor.  For
a cleric, wisdom should be high since this determines the maximum
spell level he can cast.
