COLLECT

The 'collect' command will attempt to gather all your ammo in the
room you are currently standing in.  It will automatically find your
ammo in the room, and in any corpses in the same room.  This is avery
helpful command especially if you have multiple archers fighting in the
same room.

See also: AUTOCOLLECT

