#0
CONCEALMENT

   When a person has concealment they receive a percentage chance to avoid any
melee or physical ranged attacks.  For example, if a person has 20% concealment,
any melee or ranged attack that would normally hit, instead has a 20% chance to
miss completely.  Note that concealment caps at 50%.
#0
CONCENTRATION

Usage:  automatic

Concentration affects your ability to complete the "CASTING-TIME" of spells
despite distractions such as GRAPPLED or TAUNT.  In addition, a higher
concentration rating is needed to complete more difficult spells.

Concentration is also your ability to resist extremely distracting skills
and attacks.

So far concentration help resist:
TAUNT

See also:  TAUNT CASTING-TIME GRAPPLED
