CONDEMN UNCONDEMN


 
usage:  condemn <no argument> or <spell name>
usage:  uncondemn <spell name>
 
Typing condemn without any argument will list your current list of
spells you have ready and are preparing.
 
To continue your condemnations and recover spells, simply type 'rest' and
then 'condemn' with no argument, to begin the process.
 
Type 'condemn' <spellname> to add a spell to your chant list.
 
Type 'uncondemn' <spellname> to remove a spell from your preparing list or
if you want to remove it from your prepared spell list.

