#0
CRITICAL CRITICAL-HIT

When determining whether you hit an opponent or not in melee combat, a 20-sided dice (1d20) is rolled.
On a natural roll of 1, you miss no matter how good your BAB or how bad your opponents Armor Class is.
But on a roll of 20, you are guaranteed a hit.  In addition on a roll of 20, you will do double damage
on that attack.

Careful, even mobiles get this bonus.

See also:  BAB ARMOR-CLASS
#0
CRUELTIES

Usage:  cruelties
Use this command to view and select your cruelties as a blackguard with corrupting touch.
See Also:  BlackGuard, Touch-of-Corruption, CorruptingTouch
#0
ARCANITE-CRYSTAL CRAFTING-CRYSTAL CRYSTAL

Special crystals found in the world can be used to augment crafting
in attempt to add enchantments to weapons and armor.

The first affect of the crystal will be the affect that transfers to
the item.  The level of the crystal will determine how powerful the
enchantment is.

See Also:  CRAFTING
