	nThis spell conjures a dancing weapon of force, whose type is based on the
	ncaster's alignment. This weapon will attack the caster's foe every round. It
	nwill use the caster's base attack bonus (BAB) + the highest of their charisma
	nand intelligence bonuses against the enemy's armor class. If the caster has
	nmultiple attacks from their BAB, then the weapon will attack multiple times,
	naccordingly. Upon hit the weapon will deal the normal weapon damage, plus the
	ncaster's arcane spellcasting level / 3 (max of 5). The weapon can score critical
	nhits, though the threat range and critical multiplier are unaffected by any
	nfeats or effects the caster has. Attacks can be negated with spell resistance,
	nand the damage type done is force damage.
