	D>PSP Cost:        	W 7 	n
	D>Description:	n
	n
	nYou create a mental image of the most fearsome creature imaginable to the
	nsubject simply by forming the fears of the subject’s subconscious mind into
	nsomething that its conscious mind can visualize: this most horrible beast. Only
	nthe power’s subject can see the nightmarish beast. The target first gets a
	nWill save to recognize the image as unreal. If that save fails, the beast
	ntouches the subject, and the subject must succeed on a Fortitude save or die
	nfrom fear. Even if the Fortitude save is successful, the subject takes 3d6
	npoints of damage.

This affect can be blocked by immunity to death magic, fear
	nor mind-affecting abilities.
	n
	n	DAugment: 	nFor every 2 additional power points spent, both Difficulty Classes
	nincrease by 1. If 8 augment power points are spent, this becomes an AoE spell.
	n
