#0
DEADLY-POWER

\nUsage: deadlypower\n\nThis ability, obtained as a 'Dragon Rider: Dragon Scion' bond holder, allows one\nto exchange hit points to restore the next spell in your spell prep list.  It\nworks with both arcane and divine spells, but not psionic powers.  If you have\nmultiple spellcasting classes, it will choose a class at random.\n\n

#0
DEAF DEAFENED

	n
Deafness is an affliction that makes it impossible to hear, therefore
unable to receive communication.  In addition it will counteract sound-
based benefits as well, such as bard's song.
	n
Deafness will also incur a -4 penalty to initiative checks, perception
skill checks and a 20% chance of spell failure for spells that have a verbal
component.

