DEITIES DEITY GODS PANTHEON TITANS

Divine spellcasters often receive their divine powers by worshipping and revering
divine beings called titans.  More information on titans can be found at the following link:

https://luminarimud.com/lore/the-titans-updated/

Note that for gameplay purposes, there is no current mechanic to devote oneself to a specific
titan, and that it should be role played, if desired.

