#0
DISMISS

Dismiss command will get rid of all your charmees who are not in the
same room as you.  This can be used to get rid of charmees that get
stuck.  Also you can get rid of charmees with this command - just
order your follower to rest that you want to get rid of, then leave
the room and use the 'dismiss' command to get rid of that charmee.

This is a temporary command until the charmee system is reworked.

NEW:
Usage:  dismiss <TARGET>

You can now dismiss your companion/mount/familiar if they are
in the same room, and it will drastically reduce the cool-down
of resummoning them.

See also:  ORDER CHARMEE CALL-COMPANION

