#0
DOMAIN DOMAINS

Domains

A cleric may select two domains of power they have divine influence over.
An inquisitor may select one domain.

You can view a comprehensive list of the domains by typing:
	Ydomain	n

A domain grants additional powers and bonus spells. Domain powers use the
higher of the character's cleric or inquisitor level as their domain level;
these class levels do not stack.

