#0
DWARF DWARVES RACE-DWARF RACE-DWARVES

	G-----------------------------------------------------------------	n
	G>Description:	n
	n
Dwarves are known for their skills in warfare, their ability to with-
stand physical and magical punishment, their hard work and their
capacity for drinking ales.  Dwarves are slow to jest and suspicous of
strangers, but they are generous to those who earn their trust.  They
stand just 4 to 4 1/2 feet tall, but are broad and compactly built,
almost as wide as they are tall.  Dwarven skin varies from deep tan to
light brown, and dwarven hair is black, gray or brown.  Dwarven men
value their beards highly
	n
