#0
DRINKING DRINKS EATING FOOD HUNGER HUNGRY NIBBLE SIP TASTE THIRSTY

Usage: eat (food item)
-----: drink (drink item)

Eating and drinking are not required functions on LuminariMUD. Instead they serve as
a buff system, wherein each food and drink item offer different benefits.  For example:
a green apple might give you +2 to strength for 50 rounds (a round is 6 seconds).

Food and drink also have their own bonus types, so these buffs will stack with your gear
and spells, and spell-like affects.

Currently we are in the process of editing the various food and drink items across the MUD,
as right now existing food items offer no buffs.  We will be updating the foods in Mosswood,
Ashenport and Sanctus first.  Feel free to ask a staff member where things are with food, at
any time.

