	G-----------------------------------------------------------------	n
	G>Description:	n
	n
Elves are known for their poetry, song and magical arts, but when danger
threatens they show great skill with weapons and strategy.  Elves can live
to be over 700 years old and, by human standards, are slow to make friends
and enemies, and even slower to forget them.  Elves are slim and stand at
4 1/2 to 5 1/2 feet tall.  They tend to be pale-skinned and dark-haired
with deep green eyes.  They have no facial or body hair, prefer comfort-
able clothes, and possess unearthly grace.  Many other races find them
hauntingly beautiful.
