#0
ENDORPHIN-SURGE POWER-ENDORPHIN-SURGE PSIONIC-POWER-ENDORPHIN-SURGE

	D>Usage:           	W manifest 'endorphin surge'	n
	D>Accumulative:    	W No 	n
	D>Duration:        	W 1 round / psionic level 	n
	D>Discipine:       	W Psychometabolism 	n
	D>Target(s):       	W Self Only 	n
	D>Magic Resist:    	W N/A 	n
	D>Saving Throw:    	W N/A 	n
	D>Damage Type:     	W N/A 	n
	D>PSP Cost:        	W 5 	n
	D>Description:	n
	n
	nThe glands of your body emit massive quantities of endorphins, augmenting your
	nnatural abilities. While this power is active, you are treated as if in a
	nberserker rage, giving you a +2 morale bonus to your Constitution and Strength,
	na +1 morale bonus on Will saves, and a -2 penalty to your Armor Class. The
	neffect is otherwise identical with a barbarian’s rage except you aren’t
	nfatigued at the end of the rage.
	n
	nAugment: If you spend 6 additional power points, the morale bonus to your
	nConstitution and Strength is increased by 2, and the morale bonus on Will saves
	nis increased by 1.
	n
	YSee also:	n PSIONICS
	n
