	D>Description:	n
	n
	nYou create an explosion of unstable ectoplasmic energy of your active energy type 
	n(cold, electricity, fire, acid or sonic) that deals 5d6 points of damage to every 
	ncreature or object within the area.
	n
	nCold: A blast of this energy type deals +1 point of damage per die. The saving 
	nthrow to reduce damage from a cold push is a Fortitude save instead of a Reflex save.
	n
	nElectricity: Manifesting a blast of this energy type provides a +2 bonus to the 
	nsave DC and a +2 bonus on manifester level checks for the purpose of overcoming 
	npower resistance.
	n
	nFire: A blast of this energy type deals +1 point of damage per die.
	n
	nAcid: A blast of this energy type deals +1 point of damage per die.
	n
	nSonic: Manifesting a blast of this energy type provides a +2 bonus to the save DC 
	nand a +2 bonus on manifester level checks for the purpose of overcoming power resistance.
	n
	n	DAugment: 	nFor every additional power point you spend, this power’s damage
	nincreases by one die (d6). For every two additional dice of damage, the
	npower’s save DC increases by 1.
	n
	YSee also:	n PSIONICS
	n
