	D>Usage:           	W manifest 'energy conversion'	n
	D>Accumulative:    	W No 	n
	D>Duration:        	W 10 minutes / psionic level 	n
	D>Discipine:       	W Psychometabolism 	n
	D>Target(s):       	W Self Only 	n
	D>Magic Resist:    	W Yes 	n
	D>Saving Throw:    	W None 	n
	D>Damage Type:     	W Fire, Acid, Cold, Sonic, Electric 	n
