	D>Description:	n
	n
	nAs energy adaptation (HELP ENERGY ADAPTATION), except that any energy of the
	ntypes: fire, cold, acid, sonic and electric, are absorbed up to a maximum number
	nequal to 3 x your psionic level.  This energy can be discharged at your current
	ncombat target by using the 'discharge' command.  With a successful ranged touch
	nattack roll, the target will take all of the damage you have absorbed of the
	ntype specified.  Absorbed damage does not persist over game sessions, though the
	npower itself does.
	n
	n
	n
	YSee also:	n PSIONICS, ENERGY ADAPTATION
	n
