	n
	nYou project a solid blast of energy of your active energy type (cold,
	nelectricity, fire, acid, or sonic) at a target, dealing it 2d6 points of damage.
	nIn addition, if a subject of up to one size category larger than you fails a
	nreflex saving throw, they will be knocked into a sitting position. If the power
	nis used indoors, and the prior reflex save failed, they will take an extra 2d6
	npoints of force damage from the impact (no save).
	n
	nCold: A blast of this energy type deals +1 point of damage per die (damage from 
	nimpact remains at 2d6 points). The saving throw to reduce damage from a cold push 
	nis a Fortitude save instead of a Reflex save.
	n
	nElectricity: Manifesting a blast of this energy type provides a +2 bonus to the 
	nsave DC and a +2 bonus on manifester level checks for the purpose of overcoming 
	npower resistance.
	n
	nFire: A blast of this energy type deals +1 point of damage per die (damage from 
	nimpact remains at 2d6 points).
	n
	nAcid: A blast of this energy type deals +1 point of damage per die (damage from 
	nimpact remains at 2d6 points).
	n
	nSonic: Manifesting a blast of this energy type provides a +2 bonus to the save DC 
	nand a +2 bonus on manifester level checks for the purpose of overcoming power resistance.
	n
	n	DAugment: 	nFor every 2 additional power points you spend, this power’s
	ndamage increases by one die (d6) and its save DC increases by 1. The damage
	nincrease applies to both the initial blast and any damage from impact with an
	nobject.
