#0
ENCOUNTERS-ESCAPE ESCAPE


Usage: encounters escape  

When one finds themself in a hostile encounter in the wilderness, there are multiple options
to resolve the encounter without requiring combat.

The escape option allows the character and their party to leave the encounter peacefully by various means:

speed     - If the party is fast enough, they can simply run away.  
            Note that in the case of groups, the slowest group member's speed is used.
blindness - if the enemy(ies) are blind, success is guaranteed
darkness  - If the room is dark and the enemy(ies) can't see, success is guaranteed.
fear      - If the enemy(ies) is under the influence of a fear affect, success is guaranteed.
paralyzed - If the enemy(ies) is stunned, paralyzed or otherwise unable to move, success is guaranteed.

See Also: ENCOUNTERS
#0
ESCAPE-ARTIST ESCAPEARTIST

Escape Artist

For grapple reversals, the person attempting the reversal can use
Their escape artist skill instead of their CMB.
More to be added.

#0
ESSENCE

Essence are obtained from disenchanting items - the magical essence of
the magical item condensed into a physical mass.  Essence can be combined
via AUGMENT process.

Essence when combined with arcanite crystals can increase the chance a
crafting project will become a 'master work' item.  This can result
in the item being even more powerful than mythical treasure.

See also: augment, arcanite-crystal, crafting

#0
ETHSHIFT

This ability allows the caster or someone they are grouped with to
travel to the ethereal plane.  Once there you are free to explore
the expanse or travel to other planes via portals.

Usage: ethshift <target>
