EVOLUTIONS


Evolutions are abilities obtained that apply to a summoner's eidolon. Evolutions are
similar to feats, except they affect eidolons only.  Evolutions often give
a passive bonus of some kind, but they also sometimes offer new abilities.

You can see the evolutions you know by typing: eidolon evolutions

