#0
FIND-MAGIC FINDMAGIC

This command will allow you to locate potions/scrolls/wands and staves.

Usage: findmagic [potion|scroll|wand|staff] <spell>

<spell> can be the spell name or VNUM. Do NOT use quotes.
Spell Name abbreviations are allowed.
Examples:
   findmagic potion armor
   findmagic scroll 56
  findmagic staff sanc
