FLAT-FOOTED


Flat-footed is an indication that your character is off-guard.  If you are
brought into combat before taking an action, that will make you flat-footed.

#0
FLEE

Usage:  flee

To attempt to exit in the middle of battle, type 'flee' to escape.  There is a random
chance that you will escape.  Fleeing gives your opponents an ATTACK OPPORTUNITY which
is like a free shot at you unless you make a succesful TUMBLE check with a D-C of 15.

Fleeing does not cost any experience-points.

See Also:  WIMPY ATTACK-OPPORTUNITY TUMBLE D-C DIFFICULTY-CLASS
