#0
GNOMES RACE-GNOME

	G-----------------------------------------------------------------	n
	G>Description:	n
	n
Gnomes are in wide demand as alchemists, inventors and technicians,
though most prefer to remain among their own kind in simple comfort.
Gnomes adore animals, gems and jokes, especially pranks.  They love to
learn by personal experience, and are always trying new ways to build
things.  Gnomes stand at 3 to 3 1/2 feet tall, with skin that ranges
from dark tan to woody brown.  Their hair is fair and their eyes are
often some shade of blue.  Gnomes generally wear earth tones, but like
to decorate their clothes intricately.  Males favor carefully trimmed
beards.  Gnomes live 350 to 500 years.
	n
	G>Racial Abilities:	n
	n
	WInfravision	n  
	WCombat Training Versus Giants:	n  +1 size bonus versus larger foes
	WResistance to Illusions:	n  +2 saving throw bonus against illusions
	WIllusion Affinity:	n  +2 DC opponents saves versus their illusions
	WTinker Focus:	n  +2 to concentration and listen
	n
	G>Ability Adjustments:  	W +2 Con, -2 Str 	n
	n
	G>Experience Modifier:  	W None 	n
	n
	YSee also:	n RACES
	n
