#0
HEALING-TOUCH HEALINGTOUCH

This domain ability allows a Cleric or Inquisitor to call upon healing
energies to heal themselves or another in their party.  The user must be
able to touch their target for this to be successful.  Furthermore,
the target must also be lower than half of maximum health in order
for the healing to take effect.  The amount healed increases with the
user's domain level.

Usage: healingtouch <target>
