#0
HELP-WRITE-HELPFILES HELPER


Helper is the title for the position of the individual(s)
responsible for helping compile and organize community
contributed help files and guides.

See also: Helpfiles

See also:
http://www.luminarimud.com/forums/topic/help-files/

#0
HELPFILES

Usage: help [command]

Help searches for a partial match of the entered word, including any spaces 
that may follow the word.  Help alone will give a list of the most common 
commands in the game. 

Examples:

  > help consider
    will find the help text for the consider command.

  > help magic missile
    will find the help text for the magic missile spell.

See also: COMMANDS, SOCIALS
#0
HERE

Usage: here

List the creatures and objects in your room, without repeating the description.

Example:

 > here

See also: LOOK, READ, EXAMINE
#0
HIDE

	n
Usage:  hide
To turn off:  type hide again, or perform any command not on the list below
	n
When you type hide you will attempt to avoid being spotted, effectively making
you invisible if successful.  Also if you sneak before you hide, you are able
to perform limited actions based on this list:
	n
look
trip
(movement directions)
get/take
group
affects
gtell/gsay
consider
backstab
steal
hit
kill
sit/stand
equipment
inventory
sap
scan
who
score
queue
attackqueue
	n
Your chance of success is checked against all parties who try looking in the room
or interacting with you and is based on their perception ability.
	n
Here is how the attempt is calculated:
Spotter:  1d20 + perception, if in "SPOT-MODE" you get another +10
Hider:  1d20 + 10 + stealth +/- SIZE-DIFFERENCE
	n
See Also:  SPOT SPOT-MODE SIZE-DIFFERENCE SNEAK
	n
#0
HIDEOUS-BLOW SPELL-HIDEOUS-BLOW

	D>Usage:           	W cast 'hideous blow'	n
	D>Accumulative:    	W  	n
	D>Duration:        	W Indefinite 	n
	D>School of Magic: 	W Enchantment 	n
