	D>Magic Resist:    	W  	n
	D>Saving Throw:    	W  	n
	D>Damage Type:     	W  	n
	D>Description:	n
	n
	nThis invocation charges your melee attack with the power of an eldritch blast.
	nIf you successfully hit with your melee attack, the target is affected as if
	nstruck by your eldritch blast. This damage is in addition to any weapon damage
	nthat you deal with your attack, although the eldritch blast effect will NOT
	ntrigger if no damage is caused by the weapon itself. Doing elemental damage or
	nsome other bonus damage effect from the weapon is enough though to trigger the
	nblast.
	n
	n
	n
	YSee also:	n SPELLS
	n
