#0
IN-SUNLIGHT SUNLIGHT


When a vampire is in sunlight, they lose access to most of their abilities
and bonuses.  Additionally, if they are in sunlight without cover
they will take damage every round. Cover generally consists of
wearing a piece of gear on the ABOUT wear slot, that is of
type 'Wearable'.

A character is considered to be in sunlight under the following
conditions: (not an exhaustive list)
-Time is daytime, and weather is cloudless.
-Room is not flagged as dark, magically dark or fogged.
-Room is not under the following spell/spell-like affects: darkness,
 acid fog, billowing cloud, obscuring mist, fog.
-They are outside and not underwater, in a cave or the underdark.
