#0
MASTERLIST

Usage:  masterlist <spells / skills>

This simple command will show ALL the current spells or skills
currently in the game.

See Also:  SPELLS SKILLS

#0
MASTERMIND


Usage: mastermind

This ability is acquired from the 'master of the mind' level 30 psionic ability. Once
activated, it will make the next eligible psionic power area of effect (for hostile powers)
or a group wide ability (for beneficial powers).

This ability can be used 3 times per mud day.

Note that powers which are 'self only' cannot benefit from this ability.

