#0
MISSIONS

Usage : mission (normal | tough | arduous | severe)
      : mission decline

The mission system allows players to take on bounties of NPCs that
are created and placed randomly based on the level of the character
and the specified difficulty.

Typing mission by itself will show you your current mission target and
location as well as rewards for finishing, by killing the target and all
of his/her guards.

Typing mission decline will end your current mission and allow you to select
a new one, with a standing loss from the associated faction.

The rewards for missions are also increased for those with high diplomacy
skills and charisma ability scores.

The mission system has a ten minute cooldown.  Once you've taken a mission, you
cannot take a new one for ten minutes.

Currently, missions can be received from the adventurer's guild representative
near Alerion in Ashenport

