#0
CLASS-MONK MONK

	m-----------------------------------------------------------------	n
	m>Description:	n
	n
Monks are versatile warriors skilled at fighting without weapons or
armor.  Good-aligned monks serve as protectors of the people, while
evil monks make ideal spies and assassins.  Although they don't cast
spells, monks channel a subtle energy called ki.  This energy allows
a monk to perform amazing feats, such as healing himself and dodging
blows with lightning reflexes.  A monk's mundane and ki-based
abilities grow with experience, granting him more power over himself
and his environment.  Monks suffer unique penalties if they wear
armor, as doing so violates their rigid oath.  A monk wearing armor
also loses his Wisdom and level-based Armor-Class bonuses and his
additional unarmed attacks per round.
	n
	m>Class Abilities:	n
	n
	WMonk unarmed combat	n
	n
	m>Alignment:     	W Any Lawful 	n
	m>Hit Dice:      	W 4-8 Per Level 	n
	m>Skill Points:  	W Int Modifier x 4 at 1st level, 4 + Int Modifier
each additional level	n
	m>Proficiencies:	n
	WMinimal Weapon Proficiency	n
	n
	YSee also:	n CLASSES MONK-UNARMED-COMBAT
	n
#0
MONK-GLOVES MONKGLOVES

Monk gloves are special enchanted gloves that monks can use
and will further accent their powerful unarmed attacks.  The
enhancement bonus on monk gloves will be applied to a monk's
attack bonus and damage on unarmed attacks only.

There are special monk gloves that carry further magical
enchantments that cause them to do special attacks.

#0
MONK-UNARMED-COMBAT

Monks are trained to fight without weapons or armor.  They
gain bonus armor every few levels and additional attacks.
Also their bare-hand damage will increase as they level up.

See Also:  CLASSES MONKS
