MOTD

Usage: motd

Displays the message of the day.  Contains important information regarding the 
status of the MUD.  You should be sure to read it when you login.  If you miss 
it at login, just use this command!

#0
MOUNT

Usage:  mount <intended mount>

Mount is the command corresponding to the ability mount.  The higher the skill, the
higher level the mount you can effectively use.  The intended mount target must
be a "mountable" mobile or player.

Also having a high mount ability will reduce the chance that an unTAMEd mobile will
BUCK you off.

See also:  TAME BUCK DIS
