OAK-BODY POWER-OAK-BODY

	D>Usage:           	W manifest 'oak body'	n
	D>Accumulative:    	W No 	n
	D>Duration:        	W 1 minute / psionic level 	n
	D>Discipine:       	W Psychometabolism 	n
	D>Target(s):       	W Self Only 	n
	D>Magic Resist:    	W N/A 	n
	D>Saving Throw:    	W N/A 	n
	D>Damage Type:     	W N/A 	n
	D>PSP Cost:        	W 13 	n
	D>Description:	n
	n
	nThis power transforms your body into living oak, which grants you several
	nadvantages.
	n
	nYou gain damage reduction 10/slashing and a +5 bonus to natural
	narmor that overlaps (does not stack with) any natural armor bonus you may
	nalready have. You are immune to blindness, deafness, disease,  poison, and
	nstunning.
	n
	nYou take half damage from cold effects of all kinds. However, you
	ngain vulnerability to fire.
	n
	nYou gain a +4 enhancement bonus to Strength, but you take a -2 penalty to 
	nDexterity (to a minimum Dexterity score of 1), and your speed is reduced to 
	nhalf normal. You can speak but cannot drink (and thus can't use potions).  
	nYou have an armor check penalty of -4 and an arcane spell failure chance of 25%.
	n
	nYour unarmed attacks deal damage equal to a club (1d6).
	n
	n	DAugment: 	nFor every additional power point you spend, this power's duration
	nincreases by 1 minute.
	n
	YSee also:	n PSIONICS
	n
