OBSERVING


Observing is the act of trying to detect something out of the
ordinary in your environment.

Currently the system is implemented for detecting stealth.  To
detect someone hidden, you have to enter spot-mode.  And to
detect someone sneaking, you have to enter listen-mode.

	YSee Also:	n SPOT-MODE LISTEN-MODE

