	nPrecognition allows your mind to glimpse fragments of potential future
	nevents—what you see will probably happen if no one takes action to change it.
	nHowever, your vision is incomplete, and it makes no real sense until the actual
	nevents you glimpsed begin to unfold. That’s when everything begins to come
	ntogether, and you can act, if you act swiftly, on the information you previously
	nreceived when you manifested this power. 
	n
	nYour awareness extends a fraction of a second into the future, allowing you to 
	nbetter land blows against your opponent. You gain a +1 insight bonus on your attack rolls.
	n
	nOnly one precognition power can be active at a time.
	n
	n	DAugment: 	nFor every 3 additional power points you spend, the insight bonus
	ngained on your attack rolls increases by 1.
	n
	YSee also:	n PSIONICS
