CLOSE DOORS LOCK OPEN UNLOCK

Usage: open | close | lock | unlock <door> [direction]

To open, close, lock, and unlock doors, of course.

Examples:

  > open portal
  > lock door
  > unlock door south
  > close gate

See also: KEYS, ENTER, LEAVE
