CRATES OUTFIT-CRATES OUTFITS

Usage: outfit obj (outfit crate obj keyword)
       outfit type (weapon type or armor/shield type)
       outfit list (shows options for types above)
       outfit desc (description desired for objects obtained)
       outfit confirm
       outfit confirm (confirmation code)

Gear crates, though rare, can be found in different areas. A gear create is
either a weapons crate or an armor/shield crate. To find out which, type
outfit list.  That will show you the weapon types or armor types and
shield types.

To start the process of getting the object you desire from the create, type 
outfit obj (crate keyword.  For example: 'outfit obj crate'.

Next you'll want to choose the weapon type, Eg: 'outfit type long sword' or
'outfit type full plate'.

Then, you want to provide the description you desire.
Eg. 'obj desc a silver long sword with serrated blades.

Finally, once you're comfortable with what you have, you can use 'outfit show'
to see what you've set so far, and then 'outfit confirm'.  That will show you
the same output as doing outfit show, and a confirmation code.  To finish
everything off and get your item(s), type 'outfit confirm (confirmation code)'.

