PALADIN-MOUNT

Usage:  call mount

Powerful paladins are able to summon magical mounts to come to
their service.

See Also:  PALADIN
#0
PARALYSIS PARALYZED

Being paralyzed means you cannot perform any command actions, including fleeing.  In addition
a paralyzed victim can't fight back.

See also:  STUN
#0
PARRY


You can parry incoming attacks, essentially it is the same as a missed
attack or blocked attack with shield or armoring.  It is just resolution
of attack bonus versus armor class.

There are special weapons that might respond when successfully parrying
with magical effects.

#0
PASSWORDS

Ideally, your password should be something that nobody could guess.  In 
reality, most people choose a password that is easy to remember and they never
change it. While passwords on most MUDs are encrypted there is no rule that 
they have to be. So please NEVER use a password on a MUD that you use anywhere 
else. Choose a separate MUDding password and change it occasionally.

If you forget your password any IMP can reset it for you.
