#0
HENCHMEN HIRED-MERCENARY HIRED-MOUNT HIRED-PET MERCENARIES PETS

   A few stores within the realm will allow you to buy pets. These pets are 
your obedient servants. As such you will be able to order them to do as you 
wish.

Similarly you can find henchmen and mercenaries that can be hired by gold or tasks.

Unlike CHARMEE followers, there is no limit to how many followers you can hire.

If you get separated from your NPC followers, use the 'summon' command to
bring them back to you.

There is a place to hire some henchmen in Ashenport's Jade Jug Inn.

