#0
PLAYER-OWNED-SHOP PLAYER-RAN-SHOP PLAYER-SHOP


A player ran shop works very similar to normal shops, except the items
that are for sale are determined by the player who owns the shop.
The player's shop consists of the room where the items and money from
sales are stored and a room where the shop-mobile sells the items to
the public.

To build a player-ran shop, please contact a staff member.

Note:  it is required to own a player-house first!
Current cost:  5 Million Gold

You will need:
  -A room description of the storage room for your shop
  -A room description of the shop itself
  -A mobile description of the shop seller

Staff see: Build-Player-Shop

See also: PriceSet
