CHECK MAIL RECEIVE
	n
Commands are:
-- mail list inbox            : (shows the mail in your inbox)
-- mail list sent             : (shows the mail in your outbox)
-- mail read <num>            : (read the specified mail)
-- mail delete <num>          : (deletes the specified mail for you only)
-- mail <name> <subject> : (sends a mail to specified person)
	n
The mail system allows you to send and receive private, persistent
messages to other people in the game.  These mails can be viewed at any time,
until deleted.
	n
When deleted, they will be deleted only for the person who deletes them, not
for the sender, or other recipients.
	n
When you enter the game you will receive a message in yellow if you have
new mails.
