POWER-ATTACK POWERATTACK

This feat allows the user to sacrifice accuracy in lieu of damage.
Power Attack is a "mode", a number between 1 and 5 must be chosen.
Once chosen, this amount will be subtracted from your attack rolls 
and you will gain the same amount to your damage rolls.

***NOTE*** You must have a minumum of the number subtracted as your BAB.

Usage: powerattack <1-5>
#0
POWERFUL-BLOW POWERFULBLOW

This ability will allow the Berserker, once per Rage, to strike
extremely hard.  This Berserker will gain a +1 damage bonus on a single
damage roll.  This bonus increases by +1 for every 4 Berserker levels.

Usage: powerfulblow
#0
GUILDMASTER GUILDS PRACTICE TRAIN


Usage: train [ability name]

Train is the way you improve your abilities and skills.  You can only do
so in specific locations, where a trainer can help you train.  You learn new skills
as you gain levels. A trainer can be found throughout the realms and may
charge you for your training. 

If you type train anywhere other than with a trainer, you will get a 
list of all of the skills you know and your level of proficiency at
each.

See also: SPELLS, SKILLS, LEVELS

