#0
PSIONIC-POINTS PSP


This the amount of psionic points available to your character to use
with your psionic powers.

As a base, you regenerate two psp per 5 seconds, while sitting, resting,
reclining or sleeping.  Every 10 levels, this regen rate increases by 1
psp per 5 seconds.

The psionic recovery feat increases this regen rate by another +1.

