#0
QUALINESTI-ELF QUALINESTIELF RACE-QUALINESTI-ELF

\tG>Description:\tn
\n\tn
\n\tn
\n\tnOf all the elven nations, the Qualinesti elves have 
\n\tnthe most interaction with the other races of 
\n\tnKrynn. Though some Qualinesti prefer to remain 
\n\tnin their forest homes, others can be found exploring 
\n\tnthe continent as merchants, priests, wizards, 
\n\tnand travelers. Because of their relatively long 
\n\tnlife spans, Qualinesti accept the past without 
\n\tnregret and look forward to the future. They 
\n\tnpatiently pursue their goals and have an optimistic 
\n\tnview of life. While they grieve for what has 
\n\tnbeen lost to them through the years, the Qualinesti 
\n\tndo not allow themselves to dwell on negative 
\n\tnemotions, preferring instead to look forward 
\n\tnto the next new day, the next new challenge. 
\n\tnThe Qualinesti elves take pride in their abilities, 
\n\tntending to look with disdain upon the 
\n\tn“crude” work by the obviously inferior races. 
\n\tnAlthough Qualinesti are more tolerant and outgoing 
\n\tnthan the Silvanesti and relate well with 
\n\tnother races, the Qualinesti still consider themselves 
\n\tnthe chosen of the gods. They are opposed 
\n\tnto interracial marriages and, although they may 
\n\tnoffer sanctuary to half-elves, the half-elves are 
\n\tnnever fully accepted by the Qualinesti.
\n\tn
\n\tG>Racial Abilities:\tn
\n\tn
\n\tWInfravision:\tn            - Can detect life forms in the dark.
\n\tWLunar Magic:\tn            - Learns minor illusion, sleep and moonbeam spells as they level. 1 use/day/each.
\n\tWBathed in Moonlight:\tn    - +6 to stealth skill checks when outside at night.
\n\tWEnchantment Resistance:\tn - +2 to saves vs. enchantment.
\n\tWKeen Senses:\tn            - +2 to perception and sense motive skills.
\n\tWSleep immunity:\tn         - Immune to sleep based enchantments.
\n\tWElven Weapons:\tn          - Proficient in long swords, rapiers and all bow types.
\n\tn
\n\tG>Ability Adjustments:  \tW +2 Dex, +1 Wis \tn
\n\tn
\n\tG>Experience Modifier:  \tW None \tn
\n\tn
\n\tYSee also:\tn RACES
\n\tn
\n
\n

#0
QUEST

Autoquests

Usage: quest [list | join <#> | progress | leave | history]

quest          - Show usage information for the quest command.
quest list     - Used at the questmaster to see which quests are available.
quest join #   - Used to the questmaster to join the quest listed as a number on quest list.
quest progress - Shows the player which quest they are doing, and their quest progress.
quest leave    - Allows the player to abandon the current quest, taking the quest point penalty.
quest history  - Shows all previously completed non-repeatable quests.
quest history # - Show specific quest information from a quest you completed

---------------

Homeland-Quest System

The Homeland Quest System is completely driven by speech, using the
ASK command to get info from the quest-mobile.  Then you will be
required to either bring items, money, escort the quest-mobile,
to collect your reward.

See also: AUTOQUESTS QEDIT HLQUEST HOMELAND-QUEST

