#0
RACE-SHADE SHADE

	G-----------------------------------------------------------------	n
	G>Description:	n
	n
Ambitious, ruthless, and paranoid, shades are humans who trade
part of their souls for a sliver of the Shadowfell's dark essence through a
ritual known as the Trail of Five Darknesses. Even more so than the shadowborn
(natives of the shadowfell descended of common races) shades are gloom
incarnate. No matter what nations or land one was first born into, each shade
undergoes a dark rebirth that transforms him or her into a creature of stealth
and secrecy who is caught between life and death. In exchange for the twilight
powers granted to shades, the Shadowfell taints their souls with dark thoughts
and a darker disposition. For the most part, shades resemble a twisted form of
their former stature and shape. Since they were all humans prior, they all
retain a humanoid shape. But their form is changed to that of a slender shadow
of their former selves. Their eyes become accustomed to the dark and take on
colors of grey, white, or even darker hues like black or purple. Their hair
becomes jet-black and their skin turns pale. 
	n
	G>Racial Abilities:	n
	n
	WUltravision	n        - Can see in the dark.
	WPracticed Sneak	n    - Stealth is a class skill for all classes the shade has ranks in.
	WShadowfell Mind	n    - +2 to stealth and spellcraft skills.
	WOne with Shadow	n    - Can hide even during battle with cover or concealment.
	n
	G>Ability Adjustments:  	W +2 Dex, +1 Cha 	n
	n
	G>Experience Modifier:  	W None 	n
	n
	YSee also:	n RACES
	n
#0
RACE-SILVANESTI-ELF SILVANESTI-ELF

\tG>Description:\tn
\n\tn
\n\tn
\n\tnCool, aloof, and seemingly untouchable, the Silvanesti elves
\n\tnrepresent all that is best and worst in the elven people. Their haunting beauty
\n\tnis marred by their cold and aloof natures. They consider themselves better than
\n\tnall other people on Ansalon, including their own kin, the Qualinesti and
\n\tnKagonesti. Being proud and arrogant, the Silvanesti have little use for the
\n\tnmembers of any other race, including other elves. Silvanesti are
\n\tnextremely prejudiced against the cultures of 'inferior' people, and are
\n\tnintolerant of other customs and beliefs. Silvanesti dislike change. Their
\n\tnsociety has endured for more than 3,000 years, and has changed very little in that
\n\tntime. When change does occur, it is usually forced onto them. Slow to trust and
\n\tnquick to blame, very few Silvanesti form lasting friendships with non-Silvanesti.
\n\tn
\n\tG>Racial Abilities:\tn
\n\tn
\n\tWInfravision:\tn            - Can detect life forms in the dark.
\n\tWLinguist:\tn               - Can choose an additional spoken language.
\n\tWCantript:\tn               - Can choose a single 1st circle wizard spell to cast at-will.
\n\tWEnchantment Resistance:\tn - +2 to saves vs. enchantment.
\n\tWKeen Senses:\tn            - +2 to perception and sense motive skills.
\n\tWSleep immunity:\tn         - Immune to sleep based enchantments.
\n\tWElven Weapons:\tn          - Proficient in long swords, rapiers and all bow types.
\n\tn
\n\tG>Ability Adjustments:  \tW +2 Dex, +1 Int \tn
\n\tn
\n\tG>Experience Modifier:  \tW None \tn
\n\tn
\n\tYSee also:\tn RACES
\n\tn
