#0
REACH REACH WEAPONS


   When a creature has reach it allows them to get an extra attack when they
begin battle, using either the kill, hit or backstab commands.  Other commands
will not trigger an extra reach attack.  Reach can be obtained by wielding a
reach weapon such as a longspear or halberd, or by other methods, such as having
a reach flag or eidolon reach evolution.

