#0
RECALLING

 Our game does not have a recall command. Instead, one can purchase potions of recall\nfor specific destinations (Eg. Palanthas, Sanction, etc.). Many casting\nclasses also get spells that help them instantly move about the world.\n\nIf you are lost or stuck somewhere, there is the unstuck command, which\nwill cost your character some gold and experience points.\n\n

#0
BLOOD-STARVED RECENTLY-FED


When a vampire has recently fed on a living creature, or if it has been a long
time since they have fed, they will receive special bonuses and penalties
respectively.

The abilities and stats these apply to are to attack rolls, damage rolls,
saving throws, saving throw DCs, combat maneuver bonus and defense,
skill values, spell and power damage and healing amount.

The bonus will be +2 and the penalty -2, except for spell/power damage
and healing amount where the bonus/penalty will be +20%/-20% instead.

 See Also: BLOOD DRAIN, VAMPIRE

