#0
RESEARCH

Research

At some locations throughout the world, wizard research libraries
are set up in order to teach fellow wizard's spells.  This service
costs money.

In order to research a spell, you will have to find a research
library, then just type: research <name of spell>

You have to make sure you have a spellbook available in order
to do this.

Cost of researching is the (level-of-spell * level-of-spell * 50)
for spell circles 1-6 and (level-of-spell * level-of-spell * 300)
for spell circles 7-9.
Epic spells are free once you take the appropriate feat.

#0
RESERVED

Zones marked as  with <*> have to be edited very carefully.
These zones hold items, mobiles and rooms that the code depend on
to function correctly.  These CAN be edited, but you have to be
careful not to change the nature of the respective item and to
not delete anything.  Speak with the current Lead-Builder or to
the Coder-Forger if you plan on editing these zones.

