#0
RESIZE

Worn items need to match your character's size-category.  Resize
can be used to resize items to fit your character.

To resize an item you need a 'crafting kit.'  Put the item you want
resized into the kit and type:

resize <new item size>

#0
RESPEC RETRAIN

usage:  respec <class name>
respec <class name> premade

The respec command is a way to completely reset your character.

You will start from level 1 again, everything will reset in regards to your stats.
You will be able to regain your levels simply by using the GAIN command to re-level
your character. Including "premade" at the end of the syntax will set it to the pre-
made study selections.

*Note - you do not lose anything by respeccing currently, you keep all your xp/items/
crafting skills/etc.

See also: help STUDY, PREMADE
