#0
SANCTUS

Sanctus and Midgaard are two stock 'hometown' zones that came with the
TBA codebase.  Midgaard was renamed to Midgen to fit to initial building
plans.  The plans for ALL zones in the game are to eventually be remade
fitting Luminari lore.

If you are having trouble finding your way around, try using the MAP
command.

On 11/2012 Sanctus was switched to the primary starting hometown of the
MUD.

See Also:  MAP GAME-LORE
