SCHOOL-OF-MAGIC SCHOOLS-OF-MAGIC SPECIALTY-SCHOOL WIZARD-SPECIALIST

Magical spells are divided up into different schools of practice:

Evocation - Manipulation of energy
Abjuration - Physical and magical barrier manipulation
Conjuration - Bring manifestations of objects, creatures and certain energies
Divination - Enable learning of forgotten secrets, predict future, find things
Enchantment - Magically effect the minds of others, influencing behaviour
Illusion - Deceive the sense and minds of others
Necromancy - Manipulate the powers of death and unlife
Transmutation - Change the properties of creatures, objects or conditions

See Also:  SPELLS
