#0
ABILITY-SCORE-CHECK ABILITY-SCORE-ROLL SKILL CHECK SKILL ROLL SKILLCHECK


 
Usage: skillcheck (target) (skill or ability score name)
  
The skill check command is used to roll skill checks and ability score checks
for role playing purposes.  It has no mechanical function on the rest of the MUD.
 
You will need to specify a target, which is who can see the check.  You can specify
a person in the same room as you, 'myself' if you don't want anyone else to see it,
or 'everyone' so that everyone in the room can see it.
 
Examples:
  skillcheck myself strength  : this will make a strength check that can only be seen by you.
  skillcheck gicker stealth   : this will make a stealth check that only you and gicker can see.
  skillcheck everyone perform : this will make a performance skill check that everyone in the room can see.

