#0
SORCEROUS-ENERGY

Some classes, like sorcerers and bards do not prepare their
spells via study.  Instead these classes have a more innate
connection to the magical energy, and a natural talent for
manipulating them.

These classes can cast any spell of their choice as long as
they still have 'slots' of the appropriate spell-circle level
available.  They can also recover these slots via rest and
then typing an appropriate command based on the class.  You
can check the class help files for more details, but the two
most common examples are:

Sorcerer - MEDITATE
Bard - COMPOSE

See Also:  CLASSES MEDITATE COMPOSE SPELL MEMORIZATION
