#0
SPECIAL-SIZE-MODIFIER


Sometimes attacks take into account the size of the attacker or attacked.
Here are the generic bonus/penalties for the various size-classes.

Fine, -8
Diminutive, -4
Tiny, -2
Small, -1
Medium, 0
Large, 1
Huge, 2
Gargantuan, 4
Colossal, 8

See Also: Size-Class Mob-Size

