POWER-SPECIFIED-ENERGY-ADAPTATION PSIONIC-POWER-SPECIFIED-ENERGY-ADAPTATION SPECIFIED-ENERGY-ADAPTATION

	D>Usage:           	W manifest 'specified energy adaptation'	n
	D>Accumulative:    	W No 	n
	D>Duration:        	W 10 minutes / psionic level 	n
	D>Discipine:       	W Psychometabolism 	n
	D>Target(s):       	W Self Only 	n
	D>Magic Resist:    	W N/A 	n
	D>Saving Throw:    	W N/A 	n
	D>Damage Type:     	W Active manifestation energy type 	n
	D>PSP Cost:        	W 3 	n
	D>Description:	n
	n
	nYour body assimilates some of the effect of an energy attack. You gain
	nresistance 20 against any attack that deals acid, cold, electricity, fire, or
	nsonic damage. The energy resistance provided by this power increases to 40 at
	n7th manifester level and to a maximum of 60 at 11th level.
	n
	nTo change your manifestation energy type, use the command: manifest energytype.
	n
	n	DAugment: 	nIf you spend 4 additional power points, you can manifest this power
	nas an immediate action.
	n
	YSee also:	n PSIONICS, ENERGY ADAPTATION
	n
#0
MOVEMENT-SPEED RACIAL-SPEED

The movement speed system is mainly used to determine how many movement points
a character uses as they move from room to room, zone to zone.  A higher movement
speed will result in less movement points used per room, to a minimum of 10 moves.
Most races have a base speed of 30.  Dwarves, gnomes and halflings (and other small
races) have 25.  Movement speed can also be raised or lowered through certain spells,
affects, feats and class abilities.

See Also: HELP MOVEMENT
