	D>Duration:        	W 1 hour / level (special) 	n
	D>School of Magic: 	W Conjuration 	n
	D>Target(s):       	W Self Only 	n
	D>Description:	n
	n
	nThis spell calls upon the assistance of an outsider with the same alignment as
	nthe caster.  The result is an enchantment that offers a +2 morale bonus to
	nperception skill checks, initiative rolls and the ability to detect
	nalignment.
	n
	nWhile under this effect, the caster can use the 'planarsoul'
	ncommand to dispel this effect and replace it with a new one that lasts 1 round
	nper remaining hour on the planar soul effect. This new effect offers the
	nfollowing benefits: +2 sacred bonus to AC, +4 sacred bonus to strength, +15
	nresistance to fire and acid, +5 sacred bonus on intimidate skill checks, fast
	nhealing 2, and any critical hits made while under this 'planar soul surge'
	neffect are automatically confirmed.
	n
	n
