STEALTH

	n
Stealth Skill
	c-----------------------------------------------------------------	n
	c>Usage:           	n hide, sneak 	n
	c>Key Stat:        	n Dexterity 	n
	c>Armor Penalty?:  	n Yes 	n
	c>Trained Only?:   	n Yes 	n
