#0
STUDY

STUDY

Usage: study

The study command is used to customize certain aspects of your
character, such as feats, skills, stat assignment for level 1 characters,
etc.

It is a menu-based system and can be modified as much as you like between
character levels.

If you do not like your choices and save your changes, once you reach level
2 or higher you can use the RESPEC command to restart your character from
level 1 without any experience loss so you can reconfigure your choices.

See also:  RESPEC

#0
STUN

Being stunned means you cannot perform any command actions, including fleeing.  But you will
still fight back.

See also:  PARALYSIS
