#0
AUTOCRAFTING SUPPLYORDER

Supply Orders and Auto-Crafting Quest represents local militias need for
weapons, armor and other war supplies to supplement their battle against the
growing monster presence in the world.

Follow these steps to auto-craft:
1)  Grab a auto-craft quest in a supplyorder office by typing 'supplyorder new'
2)  Buy, harvest or find materials required for the supplyorder (type score to
  see which material is required)
3)  Place the material in your CRAFTING-KIT and type 'autocraft'
4)  You will have to repeat autocrafting until you finish the whole supplyorder
5)  Return to the supplyorder office and type 'supplyorder complete'
6)  You can type 'supplyorder quit' to drop your current quest.

See Also:  CRAFTING
