#0
TELEPORT-OBJECT

We have 3 types of teleport objects, with plans for a 4th type in the
near future.

Normal:  Will teleport the user to a specified room
Random:  Will teleoprt the user to a random room within a specified range
CheckFlags:  Will teleport the user to a specified room if they qualify
  for the conditions of the object "extra flags."
  (for example, you can make an anti-good portal)

In the near future we are adding a clan portal.

See Also:  %TELEPORT% TELEPORTER
See Also:  SPELL-TELEPORT
#0
TELEPORTER

\nUnlike LuminariMUD itself, this version of the codebase does not offer a\nteleporter for players. We do offer fast travel via carriages and\nsea vessels, as well as recall potions and abilities allowing\nteleporting around the world.\n\nYou can see a list of areas with the \tYareas\tn command.\n

#0
RECALL TELEPORTERS

Usage: teleport <zone>
Other Usage: recall (No argument neccessary)

Any part of a zones name that is CAPITALIZED can be accessed by the teleporter.
i.e. "teleport sanctus"

You can see a listing of the teleportable zones by typing 'help zones'

This requires the teleporter item that players start with.
***NOTE*** The teleporter must be in your inventory for it to function.

See also:  ZONES ZONES2 ZONES3
