HEAL-SKILL SKILL-HEAL TREATINJURY

Usage:  treatinjury <target>

Prereq:  None

This ability heals the target for 10 hps + <your 'Heal' ability rating * 2>
It has a short cooldown before it can be used again.

See also:  ABILITIES

#0
RACE-TRELUX TRELUX

	G-----------------------------------------------------------------	n
	G>Description:	n
	n
Trelux have a small head with a fused thorax and abdomen. Trelux also have eight
powerful yet rough and jagged legs for leaping and stamina. Their bodies are beetle-
like with a hard shell protecting them. This exoskeleton covers their entire body 
providing ample protection. Their bodies shell contains wings underneath it which 
can be spread whenever flight is needed. Trelux also have two powerful claws in 
front of them to cut victims. Both pincers are equipped with a poisonous spur.
	n
Facts: 
*Trelux do NOT like having their antenna touched. 
*All Trelux usually have a black thorax/abdomen but a multitude of colors when it
comes to other parts of their body.
*Trelux also can have stripes, spots, or blotches on their body.
*Female Trelux usually have brighter colors than males.
*Trelux almost always have black eyes but rarely have yellow eyes.
	n
Note:  Trelux are an "epic" race and therefore have a lot
more challenging experience-chart.  Type 'levels' in-game to view
	n
	G>Racial Abilities:	n
	n
	WVital:	n start with +10 hps bonus
	WHardy:	n +4 hps bonus per level
	WUltravision	n
	RVulnerable to Cold:	n  20% weakness to cold attacks
	WTrelux Exoskeleton	n:  20% resistance to everything except cold
	WTrelux Exoskeleton	n:  Natural Armor
	WLeap	n  (help LEAP)
	WFly	n  (help TRELUX-FLY)
	RTrelux EQ	n  (help TRELUX-EQ)
	WTrelux Pincers	n  (help TRELUX-PINCERS)
	n
	G>Ability Adjustments:  	W +4 Dex, +4 Str, +4 Con
	n
	G>Experience Modifier:  	W HUGE 	n
	n
	YSee also:	n RACES EPIC-RACES TRELUX-FLY TRELUX-EQ TRELUX-EXOSKELETON TRELUX-PINCERS
	n
#0
TRELUX-EQ

Due to their pincer-like hands, Trelux cannot wield weapons, hold items,
wear gloves or wear rings.

Also due to their insect-like legs, Trelux cannot wear items on their
legs and feet.

#0
TRELUX-EXOSKELETON

Trelux have an extremely strong exoskeleton that gets harder as they
mature.

(They gain +1 AC-bonus every 5 levels)
#0
TRELUX-FLY

Commands: 'fly' and 'land'

Trelux with their large insect-like wings are able to fly at will.
#0
TRELUX-PINCERS

Trelux don't have hands, they have insect-like pincers.  These
pincers can be used as dangerous weapons.

Trelux Monks gain an extra dice of damage due to these pincers.

Also, Trelux pincers have a chance of poisoning their victim.

#0
TIRALVNUM TRAINING-VNUM TRIAL-ROOM TRIAL-VNUM TRIALROOM VNUM-APPROVAL

	n
At Luminari, we are eager to get you started, so your training is hands on
with full access to your own zone.  Before you get too in-depth into your
project though, it is highly advisable to create at least one full room
description of your choice for the staff to check.  Why?  That way if there
is any issue with the writing style, formatting, etc the staff can catch
it early so it doesn't get repeated 50 times over in a zone.
	n
Also we highly suggest submitting a proposal to discuss aspects of lore
and world geographics.
	n
Great examples: 9116, 4702
	n
See Also:  VIRTUAL-NUMBER PROPOSAL
#0
TRIG-AFFECTS

1)  BLIND          Mob is blind.
2)  INVIS          Mob is invisible.
3)  DET-ALIGN      NOT USED.
4)  DET-INVIS      Mob can see invisible characters and objects.
5)  DET-MAGIC      Mob is sensitive to magical presence.
6)  SENSE-LIFE     Mob can sense hidden life.
7)  WATWALK        Mob can traverse unswimmable water sectors.
8)  SANCT          Mob is protected by sanctuary (takes half damage).
9)  GROUP          Reserved for internal use.  Do not set.
10) CURSE          Mob is cursed.
11) INFRA          Mob can see in dark.
12) POISON         Reserved for internal use.  Do not set.
13) PROT-EVIL      Mob is protected from evil characters.
14) PROT-GOOD      Mob is protected from good characters.
15) SLEEP          Reserved for internal use.  Do not set.
16) NO_TRACK       Mob cannot be tracked.
17) FLY            Mob is flying.
18) SCUBA          Mob can breathe underwater.
19) SNEAK          Mob can move quietly without room being informed.
20) HIDE           Mob is hidden, can only be seen with sense life.
21) UNUSED         Unused (room for future expansion).
22) CHARM          Reserved for internal use.  Do not set.

Example: 	RTSTAT 166	n
