TUMBLE

Tumble is the ability that can counter-attack ATTACK-OPPORTUNITY (free attack) when
performing certain actions during combat, such as FLEE or SWITCH-OPPONENTS.  Your
tumble rating is added to a Dice roll 1d20 and compared to the D-C of the action.

