#0
POTIONS QUAFF RECITE SCROLLS STAVES USE WANDS

Usage: quaff (potion name)
       recite (scroll name)
       use (wand or staff name)
.

The usage of consumable items requires different command to perform. For potions, you
will use the quaff command.  Scrolls can use the recite command.  Wands and staves use
the use command, but must be held to be useable.
.

Potions and scrolls are consumed upon use, whereas wands and staves have a certain
number of charges before they become un-useable.
.

You may optionally use the stored consumable system instead if you like.  Read HELP
CONSUMABLES for more information on that.
.

See Also: CONSUMABLES

