VISIBLE

Usage: visible

Use this command to break your spell of invisibility before it expires.

See also: INVISIBILITY
#0
VISION

There are currently 3 levels of vision/sight:

1)  Lit, or Daylight - 100% visibility, some races get penalties
2)  Night or Darkness - Those without infravision, ultravision or
a light source will be effectively blind.  Those with infravision
will see red shapes as lifeforms and exits, but no descriptions.
Those with ultravision see perfectly in darkness.
3) Magical Darkness - Darkness that hampers vision regardless of
light levels, such as thick clouds of smoke, etc.

