	nan effect, you make a caster level check (1d20 + your caster level, maximum +10)
	nagainst a DC of (11 + the caster level of the targeted spell's caster). You make
	na caster level check for each effect on the target. If any spells on the target
	nare dispelled, the target takes 1 point of damage per two spell levels of the
	ncaster (no save, but spell resistance applies).
