FASTWALK LANDMARKS WALKING WALKTO

Usage: walkto (landmark name)
     : landmarks

The walkto system allows players to be able to travel within certain zones
automatically.  Only certain places within the zone can be traveled to. For
a list of these, type 'landmarks'. Not all zones have landmarks, usually only
larger cities.

To stop at any time type 'walkto cancel'

