CLASS-WARRIOR WARRIOR

	m-----------------------------------------------------------------	n
	m>Description:	n
	n
Warriors can be many things, from soldiers to criminal enforcerers.
Some see adventurer as a way to get rich, while other use their skills
to protect the innocent.  Fighters have the best all-around fighting
capabilities of the PC classes and they are trained to use all of the
standard weapons and armor.  A fighter's rigorous martial training
grants him many bonus feats as he progresses.  High level fighters
have access to special melee maneuvers and exotic weapons not avail-
able to any other character.
	n
