ZONE-CONTRIBUTION ZONECONTRIBUTION


We have a community project in-game to help us decide where to place zones
in the wilderness, and where to build quests ideas around.  The goal is simple:
go through a zone, take good notes, submit the notes to the public Google Sheet
and receive rewards!

Here is the link to the document:
	<send href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/14r8p53pak0W78TSBja1Qsp8DyMDN8yBXq0ZICbsJ68Y/edit?usp=sharing">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/14r8p53pak0W78TSBja1Qsp8DyMDN8yBXq0ZICbsJ68Y/edit?usp=sharing	</send>

Any questions, just ask the staff!

-LuminariMUD Staff

#0
ZONE-STATUS

	n
Zone status is a field in zlist that will show the current 'readiness-
state' of a given zone.  There are 3 categories of readiness:
	n
1)  	rIncomp	n - This stands for incomplete original zone
2)  	YN-Reva	n - This stands for needs revamping/revision (but finished)
3)  	GReady	n  - This means the zone meets minimum standards for playing
	n
To activate these different statuses, you use the zone-flags in zedit
menu for any given zone:
	n
1)  	rIncomp	n - set "Closed" flag
2)  	YN-Reva	n - make sure "Closed" and "Grid" are both OFF
3)  	GReady	n  - set "Grid" flag
	n
Please request from a Forger to decide the appropriate values for these
fields.
	n
	YSEE ALSO:	n  ZONE-FLAGS
	n
#0
ZONES

You can use your teleporter to transport to any of these zones using the
capitalized keyword.  Example:  teleport sanctus

Make sure you are supplied with a light source and food, and if you get in
