ECHO-FREQUENCY

 
This is the frequency that the echos for a mobile will appear.  Individual echos do not have a frequency, this number is defined for a mobile.  If a mobile has a 0% echo frequency, no echos will be displayed, regardless of how many echos are defined for 
hat mobile.  A mobile with 100% echo frequency will display an echo every pass of the echo processor.
 
The echos can be displayed randomly, or in sequential order, depending on the 	RECHO-TYPE	n.
 
