MOBILE-ECHOS

 
Mobile echos are small messages that are displayed to the room a mobile is in, or to the entire zone the mobile is in.  The frequency of the echos is adjustable, as well as whether the messages are displayed randomly, or in sequential order.
 
Echo Menu:
